OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer lost out by minutes in race
OL,4,Afor wildlife funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe barn owls have become one of
OL,7,FRichard Peace's favourite sights on the
OL,8,Ffarm.
OL,10,FAs dusk falls near the woods edging his
OL,11,Fland outside Nuneaton in Warwickshire,
OL,12,Fthe birds emerge to hunt over fields he
OL,13,Fhas spent years managing.
OL,15,FThis year he wanted to do more to help
OL,16,Fthem thrive.
OL,18,FTo encourage the owls, Richard planned
OL,19,Fto leave some crops unharvested near
OL,20,Fthe woodland where they live.
